posts.text:
Opening our National Parks to private developers is a red line we cannot cross. 

I’m fighting to protect Yosemite and put an end to the administration’s brazen efforts to put profit above one of our most iconic parks. 

@SenAlexPadilla and I have battled this administration’s attempts to fund this land grab in Congress. It’s time for them to stop.

